OL,3,GNEWSAStabbed councillor 'protecting
OL,4,Astaff member during street clean'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA statement on behalf of the
OL,7,Findependent councillor's family said he
OL,8,Fhad intervened to protect a council
OL,9,Fstaff member and "sustained multiple
OL,10,Fstab wounds".
